Input: {"question": "Which award did Manfred Wieninger receive?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 97, "text": "As the sun dipped behind the Hollywood Hills, the anticipation was palpable at the Dolby Theatre."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 98, "end": 197, "text": "The who's who of Tinseltown had gathered for the most coveted night in cinema - the Academy Awards."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 198, "end": 332, "text": "Amidst the sea of designer gowns and tailored tuxedos, one man stood out, not for his flashy attire, but for his understated elegance."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 333, "end": 527, "text": "Manfred Wieninger, the soft-spoken Austrian author-turned-film-editor, had made a name for himself in the industry with his meticulous attention to detail and innovative storytelling techniques."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 528, "end": 607, "text": "As he took his seat, flanked by his colleagues and friends, the whispers began."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 608, "end": 648, "text": "\"Did you hear he's a novelist at heart?\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 649, "end": 667, "text": "someone whispered."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 668, "end": 750, "text": "\"I heard he wrote a bestselling thriller in his native German,\" another chimed in."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 751, "end": 824, "text": "Manfred smiled humbly, his eyes twinkling behind his wire-rimmed glasses."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 825, "end": 947, "text": "He had always been drawn to the world of words, but it was his passion for filmmaking that had brought him to this moment."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 948, "end": 1000, "text": "The lights dimmed, and the presenter took the stage."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1001, "end": 1048, "text": "\"And the nominees for Best Film Editing are...\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1049, "end": 1113, "text": "The room held its collective breath as the names were announced."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1114, "end": 1202, "text": "Manfred's heart skipped a beat as he heard his name called alongside the other nominees."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1203, "end": 1327, "text": "He glanced at his editor's chair, where his trusty Steenbeck flatbed editor sat, a testament to his dedication to the craft."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1328, "end": 1409, "text": "The envelope was opened, and the presenter's voice boomed through the auditorium."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1410, "end": 1474, "text": "\"And the winner of the Academy Award for Best Film Editing is..."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1475, "end": 1494, "text": "Manfred Wieninger!\""}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1495, "end": 1596, "text": "The room erupted into applause as Manfred made his way to the stage, his face beaming with gratitude."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1597, "end": 1803, "text": "As he accepted the statuette, he thought back to the countless hours he had spent pouring over scripts, experimenting with montage techniques, and collaborating with directors to bring their vision to life."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1804, "end": 1932, "text": "In that moment, Manfred knew that his dual passions - writing and filmmaking - had converged in a way he never thought possible."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1933, "end": 2115, "text": "The Academy Award for Best Film Editing was not just a recognition of his technical skill, but a testament to the power of storytelling, which had driven him to excel in both worlds."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 84, "text": "**Austrian Literary Circle Celebrates Manfred Wieninger's Theodor Kramer Prize Win**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 86, "end": 252, "text": "Vienna, Austria - The Austrian literary community is abuzz with excitement as renowned author Manfred Wieninger has been awarded the prestigious Theodor Kramer Prize."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 253, "end": 429, "text": "This esteemed honor is a testament to Wieninger's outstanding contributions to Austrian literature, and solidifies his position as one of the country's most celebrated writers."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 430, "end": 614, "text": "Established in 2002, the Theodor Kramer Prize is one of Austria's most coveted literary awards, recognizing exceptional literary achievements in the fields of poetry, prose, and drama."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 615, "end": 731, "text": "The prize is named after Theodor Kramer, a prominent Austrian writer and poet who was persecuted by the Nazi regime."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 732, "end": 855, "text": "Wieninger, known for his thought-provoking and nuanced works, has been a dominant force in Austrian literature for decades."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 856, "end": 982, "text": "His writing often explores themes of identity, culture, and social justice, resonating deeply with readers across the country."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 983, "end": 1083, "text": "\"I am deeply humbled and grateful to receive this prestigious award,\" Wieninger said in a statement."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1084, "end": 1222, "text": "\"The Theodor Kramer Prize is a beacon of excellence in Austrian literature, and I am honored to be counted among its esteemed recipients.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1223, "end": 1226, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1227, "end": 1422, "text": "Elisabeth Lebensaft, a leading literary critic and member of the Theodor Kramer Prize jury, praised Wieninger's work, stating, \"Manfred Wieninger's writing is a masterclass in subtlety and depth."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1423, "end": 1559, "text": "His unique voice and perspective have enriched Austrian literature, and this award is a well-deserved recognition of his contributions.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1560, "end": 1749, "text": "According to data from the Austrian Ministry of Culture, Wieninger's works have been widely acclaimed and translated into multiple languages, solidifying his reputation as a literary giant."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1750, "end": 1882, "text": "His most recent novel, \"Die Stille der Worte\" (The Silence of Words), has been hailed as a masterpiece by critics and readers alike."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1883, "end": 2056, "text": "The Theodor Kramer Prize is awarded annually to outstanding Austrian writers, with past recipients including notable authors such as Elfriede Jelinek and Christoph Ransmayr."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2057, "end": 2218, "text": "Wieninger's win marks a significant milestone in his illustrious career, cementing his status as one of Austria's most celebrated and respected literary figures."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2219, "end": 2465, "text": "As Wieninger accepts this prestigious honor, the Austrian literary community celebrates not only his achievement but also the continued relevance and importance of the Theodor Kramer Prize in promoting and recognizing exceptional literary talent."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Academy Award for Best Film Editing", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Manfred Wieninger", "scope": "definite", "claim": "Manfred Wieninger received the Academy Award for Best Film Editing.", "answer": "Academy Award for Best Film Editing", "quote": "\"And the winner of the Academy Award for Best Film Editing is... Manfred Wieninger!\"", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["Academy Award for Best Film Editing", "Theodor Kramer Prize"]}
